Dictionaries
  The Ukrainian, Russian and English dictionaries (res/raw-uk, res/raw-ru,
  res/raw-en: main.dict) are adapted from the word frequency data of wordfreq
  3.1.1 by Robyn Speer (https://github.com/rspeer/wordfreq) and are licensed
  under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International license
  (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/). Changes: words filtered,
  some spellings corrected (hyphens, apostrophes), frequencies scaled to the
  keyboard's dictionary format.
  The wordfreq data includes data from Wikipedia (CC BY-SA); OpenSubtitles 2018
  via OPUS (http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles.php), attributed to OpenSubtitles
  (http://www.opensubtitles.org/); the SUBTLEX word lists by Marc Brysbaert et
  al. (http://crr.ugent.be/programs-data/subtitle-frequencies), freely available
  data; Google Books Ngrams (http://books.google.com/ngrams); ParaCrawl
  (https://paracrawl.eu); the Leeds Internet Corpus (University of Leeds Centre
  for Translation Studies); and word statistics from the Twitter streaming API.

